{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】APEC領導人會議周，新聞中心今日(11月16日)下午在深圳舉行兩場記者會。同日，立法會公務員及資助機構員工事務委員會開會，討論為政府僱員提供家庭友善僱傭措施。</p><p>採訪日誌｜APEC記者會／立法會討論為政府僱員提供家庭友善措施</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T23:49:26.628989+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T23:21:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T23:42:56.097377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T23:42:56.097377+00:00","content_hash":"8cd689dd31ec5f691dfb51384dba11676332a703b223d0fb9dadb200029304a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}